    "notes": "Q747541 and OSM way 1161318094 identify the station. The historic entrance faces Place Louis-Armand and the two train sheds open southeast along the mapped tracks. Façade ornament, clock details and annex elevations are simplified from exterior photographs. The shed glazing uses a patterned opaque shared material. Platforms follow the mapped plan and coarse Terrarium grade. This exterior visualization omits underground areas, operating systems, interior concourses and annexes beyond the modeled footprints. Physical-device timings are unmeasured."
